# Findings — Controls & Compliance Audit (Botium Toys)

## Controls Assessment Findings

### What Is in Place
- Firewall — network perimeter is protected against known bad traffic
- Antivirus software — endpoints are protected from malware
- Physical security — locks, CCTV, and fire systems protect on-premises assets

### Critical Gaps Identified

#### Access Control
- No Least Privilege policy — all employees currently have access to customer data, including cardholder information; this massively expands the attack surface
- No Separation of Duties — no checks prevent any single employee from having unchecked access or control over sensitive systems

#### Data Protection
- No Encryption — credit card data and PII are stored and transmitted in plaintext; a direct violation of PCI DSS and a critical data exposure risk
- No Password Policy — no enforced standards for password strength or rotation
- No Password Management System — no centralised credential management

#### Detection & Response
- No IDS — the company has zero visibility into active intrusions or anomalous traffic
- No Backups — no data recovery path exists after ransomware, hardware failure, or accidental deletion
- No Disaster Recovery Plan — no documented process for restoring operations after an incident

#### Legacy Systems
- No monitoring or maintenance schedule — legacy systems run unpatched and unobserved; known vulnerabilities may exist and go unaddressed indefinitely
---

## Compliance Findings

### PCI DSS — All Four Requirements Failing
The company is non-compliant across every assessed PCI DSS control. Unencrypted card data, unrestricted access, and absent password policies are the primary issues.

### GDPR — Partially Compliant
- 72-hour breach notification plan exists
- Privacy policies are documented and enforced
- E.U. customer data is not adequately secured
- Data has not been classified or inventoried

### SOC Type 1 & 2 — Mostly Non-Compliant
- Data integrity controls are in place
- No user access policies
- PII/SPII confidentiality not maintained
- Data access is not restricted to authorized individuals
